{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36543","headline":"春日过寿安山馆 · 罗邺","name":"春日过寿安山馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧国多将泉石亲，西游爱此拂行尘。\n帘开山色离亭午，步入松香别岛春。\n谁肯暂安耕钓地，相逢谩叹路岐身。\n归期不及桃花水，江上何曾鱠雪鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}